{"Title":"An Act relative to protecting our waterways ","BillNumber":"H2390","DocketNumber":"HD2004","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"AJP1","Name":"Angelo J. Puppolo, Jr.","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/AJP1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-19T09:21:28.29"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"AJP1","Name":"Angelo J. Puppolo, Jr.","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/AJP1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-19T09:21:28.29"},{"Id":"ALS1","Name":"Aaron L. Saunders","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/ALS1","ResponseDate":"2023-02-08T12:02:34.1"},{"Id":"BMA1","Name":"Brian M. Ashe","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/BMA1","ResponseDate":"2023-03-08T15:16:47.8133333"},{"Id":"N_C0","Name":"Nick Collins","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/N_C0","ResponseDate":"2024-01-22T08:50:14.6966667"}],"JointSponsor":null,"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/H2390/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":"By Representative Puppolo of Springfield, a petition (accompanied by bill, House, No. 2390) of Angelo J. Puppolo, Jr., Aaron L. Saunders and Brian M. Ashe for legislation to further regulate the enforcement of waterways.  Public Safety and Homeland Security.","DocumentText":"\tSECTION 1. Section 12 of Chapter 90B of the General Laws, as so appearing, is hereby amended, in the first paragraph, by inserting after the words “ by members of the state police,” the following: “by deputy sheriffs”\r\n\tSECTION 2. Section 10G of Chapter 21A of the General Laws, as so appearing, is hereby amended, in the first paragraph, by inserting after the words “members of the state police,” the following: “deputy sheriffs”\r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendation